    <string name="workspace_settings_rail_button_leading_desc">竖屏时位于标签页之前，横屏时位于标签页上方。</string>
    <string name="workspace_settings_rail_button_trailing">末尾位置</string>
    <string name="workspace_settings_rail_button_trailing_desc">竖屏时位于标签页之后，横屏时位于标签页下方。方便单手操作时拇指触及。</string>

